@FeedbackApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5076

POST {{FeedbackApi_HostAddress}}/api/feedbacks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "linkCode": "link-code",
  "autorCode": "autor-code",
  "text": "Comentário sobre o nó",
  "rating": 5
}

###

GET {{FeedbackApi_HostAddress}}/api/feedbacks?linkCode=link-code
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{FeedbackApi_HostAddress}}/api/feedbacks?linkCodes=link-code-1&linkCodes=link-code-2
